{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/0f2b81aea8b5a782e14d799fb4e36c85.poster.avif?t=1759723245\" width=614 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/0f2b81aea8b5a782e14d799fb4e36c85.webm?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/0f2b81aea8b5a782e14d799fb4e36c85.mp4?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-shameless thief, cursed with a slow, agonizing death, must now embark on a perilous journey to the top of the legendary Tower of Trials. This 2.5D action RPG challenges you to master lightning-fast reflexes and precise typing to battle hordes of fearsome monsters guarding each floor. Harness powerful spells, uncover treasures, and push yourself to the limits in your battle against the unknowns. Will you rise to the challenge and break the curse, or will you become another victim?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TYPE THE SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various magic spells to fight off enemies and clear your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/1b58cddc643e08ff2438c493a950d466.poster.avif?t=1759723245\" width=614 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/1b58cddc643e08ff2438c493a950d466.webm?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/1b58cddc643e08ff2438c493a950d466.mp4?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNCOVER THE TRUTH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out the story behind the world of TypeCaster, and the future that awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/95a50873a6229cfb6f2f6ee5e786fe05.poster.avif?t=1759723245\" width=614 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/95a50873a6229cfb6f2f6ee5e786fe05.webm?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/95a50873a6229cfb6f2f6ee5e786fe05.mp4?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your typing skills to the test and defeat  challenging bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/5f205c9c193850435165ba7391e78b8e.poster.avif?t=1759723245\" width=614 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/5f205c9c193850435165ba7391e78b8e.webm?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/extras/5f205c9c193850435165ba7391e78b8e.mp4?t=1759723245\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975280?t=1759723245","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975280?t=1759723245","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975280/d587919ac0efaf17281913daedf925f487864bc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759723245","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steams